<title>POLAND: Polish food price data for July 11-20 delayed.</title>
<headline>Polish food price data for July 11-20 delayed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food price data for the July 20-30 period has been delayed to July 30, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said in a statement on Monday. The data were earlier scheduled for relase on July 28.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
